    "turn_idx": 19,
    "turn_text": "Well, First of all, let me say, one, I'm glad that you are where you're at in terms of the committees of jurisdiction that you are serving on are so, so important as these discussions unfold, because the money's got to come from somewhere, right? So let me say thank you because you're on the front line serving on these committees right at the heart of the discussions. I'd also say, you know, Missouri has a long history of leading the fight to repeal the death tax. And can he hold soft? held that torch at one point, and we're really proud that you have taken that torch and showing yet again that Missouri leads on this issue. So thank you for doing that.",
