    "turn_text": "Well, you mentioned China a minute ago and we have had a question come in. Again, Ways and Means you oversee trade. What are you hearing in terms of oversight of trade with China? We've had a question come in just about what your thoughts are with the status of trade negotiations. I mean, obviously phase ones in effect, but what's happening within the Ways and Means Committee? What are you hearing?",
