    "turn_text": "Well, appreciate your time. You are known for your work ethic, Jason, and just know that with everything going on, we just, we can't thank you enough. We're right there with you. You'll be hearing more out of us as we approach death tax and some of these issues and fighting for not just our members, but what's right, right? Cross the board. Just thank you. We'll be in touch and tell your staff, thank you as well. We appreciate you",
