    "turn_text": "All right, we are quickly approaching wrap up time. I will ask Spencer, Kelly, Leslie, Eric, if there's anything that they want to make sure to bring up, I will note again the call to action for any estate tax stories that you all may have either on the planning side or the experience on the back end. There has been a link that's been provided if you want to go to the Legislative Action Center to be able to weigh in. Or as always, feel free to pick up the phone and give us a call and share us your story. Again, we'll be making plans for the next virtual legislative briefing. Again, probably giving you a lay of the land in terms of where our priority issues sit as we think through the remainder of the state legislative session. Anything else, team? If not, thank you all very much for tuning in. Get some work done and we'll be talking to you soon.",
